%% section: Deep dives
flowchart TB
    A["Worker picks up a job"] --> B["Derivative key = hash of source id, size and format"]
    B --> C{"Worker dies mid-encode"}
    C --> D["Lease expires, job returns to the queue"]
    D --> E["Another worker redoes it"]
    E --> F["Writes to the same deterministic key"]
    F --> G["Overwrite, not a duplicate — retries are safe"]
    C --> H{"Job fails repeatedly"}
    H --> I["Backoff, then the dead-letter queue after N attempts"]
    I --> J["A poison image cannot occupy the pool forever"]
